WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.750
In the verse 15.7,

2
00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:34.708
Lord Krishna described

3
00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:37.125
 the soul’s eternal nature and its

4
00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:39.625
struggle with the mind and senses.

5
00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:42.958
Now in verse 15.8 He explains

6
00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:44.041
how

7
00:00:44.041 --> 00:00:46.041
the soul moves from one body

8
00:00:46.041 --> 00:00:48.500
to another,

9
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.750
and carries with it

10
00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.083
the sanskaras

11
00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:54.416
and conceptions gathered in previous lives –

12
00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:58.083
which become the path for the next birth.

13
00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:01.166
This verse clarifies the process of the soul’s

14
00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:02.875
continuous change

15
00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:04.750
and rebirth.

16
00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.708
Lord Krishna explains that the soul’s next

17
00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:10.833
destination is not determined by chance,

18
00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:14.166
but by the conceptions

19
00:01:14.166 --> 00:01:15.750
and vasanas

20
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:18.750
accumulated within it.

21
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.875
‘Shariram yad avapnoti yach
chapyutkramatishvarah.’

22
00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:32.458
The soul – referred to here as Ishvarah –

23
00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:34.625
enters one body

24
00:01:34.625 --> 00:01:37.000
and then, departing from it, moves on

25
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.750
to another.

26
00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.833
The word Ishvarah is significant.

27
00:01:41.833 --> 00:01:45.125
Although the soul is not the Supreme Lord,

28
00:01:45.125 --> 00:01:48.000
within the limited domain of its body

29
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:48.958
and consciousness,

30
00:01:48.958 --> 00:01:53.250
it exercises a degree of control.

31
00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.833
The soul is not entirely helpless –

32
00:01:56.833 --> 00:01:59.375
it chooses, desires,

33
00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:00.833
and reacts.

34
00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:03.000
And based on those choices,

35
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.958
its destiny is shaped.

36
00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:10.958
‘Grihitvaitani samyati vayur
gandhan ivashayat.’

37
00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:13.541
Just as the wind, wherever it passes,

38
00:02:13.541 --> 00:02:15.000
carries that

39
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.458
fragrance or foul smell with it,

40
00:02:18.458 --> 00:02:21.708
the soul too carries its sanskaras

41
00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:25.583
and conceptions into the next body.

42
00:02:25.583 --> 00:02:28.875
When wind passes over a flower,

43
00:02:28.875 --> 00:02:32.458
it carries that sweet fragrance.

44
00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:35.416
When the same wind passes over refuse,

45
00:02:35.416 --> 00:02:38.000
it carries that foul smell too.

46
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.000
The wind itself is odourless –

47
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.125
it only carries

48
00:02:41.125 --> 00:02:45.958
what it comes into contact with.

49
00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:49.625
In the same way, the soul is originally pure,

50
00:02:49.625 --> 00:02:52.583
but as it passes through material experiences,

51
00:02:52.583 --> 00:02:55.625
it absorbs memories,

52
00:02:55.625 --> 00:02:59.000
desires, and sanskaras.

53
00:02:59.000 --> 00:02:59.875
From these accumulated

54
00:02:59.875 --> 00:03:02.750
sanskaras, vasanas – deep tendencies –
are formed.

55
00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:05.750
And these vasanas shape the future.

56
00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:09.000
If someone constantly desires sensory pleasure,

57
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.125
the soul carries that desire into such

58
00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:13.916
a body,

59
00:03:13.916 --> 00:03:16.750
where that enjoyment is possible.

60
00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:20.250
And if someone nourishes divine thoughts,

61
00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:23.375
the soul moves in that direction.

62
00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:26.166
Thus the soul’s next birth

63
00:03:26.166 --> 00:03:29.625
is not determined by coincidence, but by the

64
00:03:29.625 --> 00:03:33.250
sanskaras and conceptions
accumulated within it.

65
00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:36.541
Here Lord Krishna is explaining this –

66
00:03:36.541 --> 00:03:40.250
even if we cannot fully control

67
00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.541
our circumstances,

68
00:03:41.541 --> 00:03:43.916
we can certainly control

69
00:03:43.916 --> 00:03:45.958
our responses.

70
00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:49.333
The metaphor of the wind shows that the soul

71
00:03:49.333 --> 00:03:50.250
can easily

72
00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.250
carry good

73
00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:54.500
or bad sanskaras with it.

74
00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.000
But Lord Krishna,

75
00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:59.833
by calling the soul Ishvarah, reminds us

76
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:03.000
that we are not only products of the past,

77
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:03.750
but also

78
00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:07.958
participants in shaping our future.

79
00:04:07.958 --> 00:04:11.333
So the karshati – the struggle

80
00:04:11.333 --> 00:04:13.916
and pain described earlier –

81
00:04:13.916 --> 00:04:15.958
is not permanent.

82
00:04:15.958 --> 00:04:18.833
If we consciously choose our company

83
00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:21.125
and our thoughts,

84
00:04:21.125 --> 00:04:25.041
we can change the direction of our future.

85
00:04:25.041 --> 00:04:27.541
This verse gives a gentle

86
00:04:27.541 --> 00:04:30.250
but profound reminder –

87
00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.666
your current circumstances may not have been

88
00:04:33.666 --> 00:04:36.791
your choice, but your next destination

89
00:04:36.791 --> 00:04:40.500
can certainly be shaped by your choices.

90
00:04:45.541 --> 00:04:47.708
Think about this –

91
00:04:47.708 --> 00:04:52.208
your mind is like a travel bag

92
00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:54.833
you carry on a journey.

93
00:04:54.833 --> 00:04:57.125
Wherever you go –

94
00:04:57.125 --> 00:05:00.708
a new job, a new city, a new relationship –

95
00:05:00.708 --> 00:05:04.875
you take that same bag along.

96
00:05:04.875 --> 00:05:07.583
And if this bag

97
00:05:07.583 --> 00:05:10.833
is filled with unnecessary weight –

98
00:05:10.833 --> 00:05:15.750
fear, bitterness, or old habits –

99
00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:19.125
it will make you heavy.

100
00:05:19.125 --> 00:05:23.250
I have said – the soul carries its conceptions

101
00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.833
the way

102
00:05:24.833 --> 00:05:29.125
the wind carries fragrance.

103
00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:34.041
You think the situation has changed,

104
00:05:34.041 --> 00:05:39.083
but if the inner weight is the same,

105
00:05:39.083 --> 00:05:43.000
the same problems come back –

106
00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:47.708
only the names and faces change.

107
00:05:47.708 --> 00:05:53.833
This is why I called you Ishvarah –

108
00:05:53.833 --> 00:05:57.250
you have this power, don’t you?

109
00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:01.666
What do you carry?

110
00:06:01.666 --> 00:06:06.125
Fill your mind with the right things –

111
00:06:06.125 --> 00:06:11.500
reflection, gratitude, and truth.

112
00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:12.583
Bitterness,

113
00:06:12.583 --> 00:06:15.541
comparison, and the stories

114
00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:19.333
that no longer serve you –

115
00:06:19.333 --> 00:06:21.333
let them go.

116
00:06:21.333 --> 00:06:23.958
Your next step

117
00:06:23.958 --> 00:06:26.916
depends not only

118
00:06:26.916 --> 00:06:30.041
on where you are going, but

119
00:06:30.041 --> 00:06:34.583
on what is filled in your mind

120
00:06:34.583 --> 00:06:38.083
when you arrive there.

121
00:06:38.083 --> 00:06:41.250
So for this journey,

122
00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.166
pack wisely.

123
00:06:44.166 --> 00:06:46.333
Travel light,

124
00:06:46.333 --> 00:06:49.125
and carry only

125
00:06:49.125 --> 00:06:51.208
what brings you

126
00:06:51.208 --> 00:06:53.666
closer to Me.

127
00:06:58.708 --> 00:07:01.000
Children often

128
00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.000
forget

129
00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.041
what you said,

130
00:07:06.041 --> 00:07:08.291
but the feeling

131
00:07:08.291 --> 00:07:11.000
your words gave them,

132
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:14.333
they never forget.

133
00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:16.208
Every word of yours,

134
00:07:16.208 --> 00:07:19.000
every reaction, every habit

135
00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:23.541
leaves a deep impression on their mind.

136
00:07:23.541 --> 00:07:28.041
The soul carries these impressions –

137
00:07:28.041 --> 00:07:32.333
the way the wind carries fragrance.

138
00:07:32.333 --> 00:07:35.791
So stay alert.

139
00:07:35.791 --> 00:07:39.000
A harsh word spoken in anger

140
00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:43.541
can leave such a wound on their mind

141
00:07:43.541 --> 00:07:47.541
that takes a very long time to heal.

142
00:07:47.541 --> 00:07:51.958
And a single moment of affection

143
00:07:51.958 --> 00:07:56.791
can become a lifelong support.

144
00:07:56.791 --> 00:07:57.666
You are not only

145
00:07:57.666 --> 00:08:01.208
raising children –

146
00:08:01.208 --> 00:08:04.958
you are shaping souls.

147
00:08:04.958 --> 00:08:09.291
The atmosphere you create in your home –

148
00:08:09.291 --> 00:08:13.458
kindness or control, respect or fear –

149
00:08:13.458 --> 00:08:17.291
settles within them

150
00:08:17.291 --> 00:08:22.541
and becomes bound to their journey ahead.

151
00:08:22.541 --> 00:08:24.708
Remember –

152
00:08:24.708 --> 00:08:28.666
there must have been teachers whose warmth

153
00:08:28.666 --> 00:08:31.125
and guidance still shines

154
00:08:31.125 --> 00:08:35.875
bright in your memory today.

155
00:08:35.875 --> 00:08:37.833
And there may also be

156
00:08:37.833 --> 00:08:41.791
memories of harsh treatment

157
00:08:41.791 --> 00:08:44.166
that deeply wounded

158
00:08:44.166 --> 00:08:47.875
a tender childhood heart.

159
00:08:47.875 --> 00:08:51.041
Life may pass quickly,

160
00:08:51.041 --> 00:08:54.916
but the impressions formed today,

161
00:08:54.916 --> 00:08:59.500
their effect travels very far.

162
00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:03.333
So choose your responses

163
00:09:03.333 --> 00:09:05.583
thoughtfully.

164
00:09:05.583 --> 00:09:08.208
Build a home

165
00:09:08.208 --> 00:09:10.666
where what is carried forward

166
00:09:10.666 --> 00:09:15.916
is love, strength, and truth.

167
00:09:15.916 --> 00:09:19.958
What you give now – its echo

168
00:09:19.958 --> 00:09:24.291
travels further than you know.

169
00:09:24.291 --> 00:09:27.500
So be gentle,

170
00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:31.208
be alert, and be wise.

171
00:09:31.208 --> 00:09:32.625
Give love,

172
00:09:32.625 --> 00:09:36.791
give support, give good wishes.

173
00:09:36.791 --> 00:09:40.958
These gifts to the souls of your family

174
00:09:40.958 --> 00:09:44.000
for their journey ahead –

175
00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.833
love, support, and good wishes –

176
00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:52.000
will bring them toward Me.

177
00:09:57.458 --> 00:09:59.458
You may think

178
00:09:59.458 --> 00:10:01.916
that a career is shaped

179
00:10:01.916 --> 00:10:03.916
by coincidence –

180
00:10:03.916 --> 00:10:07.083
the right time, the right project,

181
00:10:07.083 --> 00:10:10.000
the right person’s attention.

182
00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:13.083
But that is not so.

183
00:10:13.083 --> 00:10:16.541
Nothing happens without reason.

184
00:10:16.541 --> 00:10:21.250
The mind is continuously building from within.

185
00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:25.166
What you think, believe,

186
00:10:25.166 --> 00:10:30.500
and repeat today – becomes the
foundation of tomorrow.

187
00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:34.791
I have said – the soul carries the
imprint of thoughts

188
00:10:34.791 --> 00:10:39.250
the way the wind carries fragrance.

189
00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:42.958
Just as the wind takes with it

190
00:10:42.958 --> 00:10:46.583
whatever it touches, your mind too

191
00:10:46.583 --> 00:10:48.375
carries forward whatever

192
00:10:48.375 --> 00:10:52.208
it comes into contact with.

193
00:10:52.208 --> 00:10:56.500
These conceptions do not just
stay seated within.

194
00:10:56.500 --> 00:11:00.208
They shape your perspective, your actions,

195
00:11:00.208 --> 00:11:03.041
and your path.

196
00:11:03.041 --> 00:11:06.000
For example – suppose you are meeting

197
00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:07.166
a major client

198
00:11:07.166 --> 00:11:10.583
to present a product.

199
00:11:10.583 --> 00:11:13.583
If your mind is filled with fear,

200
00:11:13.583 --> 00:11:17.083
doubt, or undue pressure,

201
00:11:17.083 --> 00:11:20.666
you may lose a good deal.

202
00:11:20.666 --> 00:11:25.875
But if you present the same deal
with clarity, quality,

203
00:11:25.875 --> 00:11:29.625
and honest value,

204
00:11:29.625 --> 00:11:33.250
the outcome is entirely different.

205
00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:36.916
If you fill the mind with fear, doubt,

206
00:11:36.916 --> 00:11:41.375
or the need to prove yourself,

207
00:11:41.375 --> 00:11:45.791
your journey becomes just that.

208
00:11:45.791 --> 00:11:49.500
But if you cultivate it with clarity,

209
00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:50.875
purpose, and

210
00:11:50.875 --> 00:11:54.250
integrity,

211
00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:57.958
life takes a different direction.

212
00:11:57.958 --> 00:12:02.416
Your future is shaped not only by effort –

213
00:12:02.416 --> 00:12:06.333
it also takes shape from the
awareness within you.

214
00:12:06.333 --> 00:12:10.083
So sow the seeds from within –

215
00:12:10.083 --> 00:12:14.125
only then will you reap the right fruits in time.
